{"2525320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pizza Dash", "steam_appid": 2525320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/06d3186d79ca1c8de38d775a606eb419.webp?t=1780295384\" width=319 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizza Dash is a high-speed first-person delivery game with a simple goal. &quot;Deliver pizzas as fast as possible!&quot;<br> Race against the clock across a variety of challenging locations, optimizing your routes and pushing your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f6ce060a3bb8d7b4ad7bc8d73d67b506.poster.avif?t=1780295384\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f6ce060a3bb8d7b4ad7bc8d73d67b506.webm?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f6ce060a3bb8d7b4ad7bc8d73d67b506.mp4?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/97c0f894ef908e26e42114e470b91637.webp?t=1780295384\" width=323 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master advanced movement mechanics like bunny hopping and surfing to blaze through dynamic levels and deliver pizzas at lightning speed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f16e48de744f373fc2c10ace6228e750.poster.avif?t=1780295384\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f16e48de744f373fc2c10ace6228e750.webm?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f16e48de744f373fc2c10ace6228e750.mp4?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/3d2ab9d9281dcbac6e66d2b0b2df5219.webp?t=1780295384\" width=437 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you deliver, the faster you will climb the leaderboards, and prove you’re the ultimate Pizza Dasher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/d39248be444993651f7c61e640189c2e.poster.avif?t=1780295384\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/d39248be444993651f7c61e640189c2e.webm?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/d39248be444993651f7c61e640189c2e.mp4?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/6edecb8019061d7bacf9e6a0bf32567d.webp?t=1780295384\" width=457 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the challenge doesn’t stop there. With a built-in level editor, you can create and share your own custom delivery routes through the steam workshop, offering endless replayability and competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/712cffe31b3756c4d2ad818f0b1c1622.poster.avif?t=1780295384\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/712cffe31b3756c4d2ad818f0b1c1622.webm?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/712cffe31b3756c4d2ad818f0b1c1622.mp4?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced first-person movement with bunny hopping and surfing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time attack gameplay focused on speed and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple  locations with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medal system and global leaderboards per route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost system to see how other players achieved their time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor to create and share custom routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver fast. Move faster. Become a legend of Pizza Dash!</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/06d3186d79ca1c8de38d775a606eb419.webp?t=1780295384\" width=319 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizza Dash is a high-speed first-person delivery game with a simple goal. &quot;Deliver pizzas as fast as possible!&quot;<br> Race against the clock across a variety of challenging locations, optimizing your routes and pushing your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f6ce060a3bb8d7b4ad7bc8d73d67b506.poster.avif?t=1780295384\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f6ce060a3bb8d7b4ad7bc8d73d67b506.webm?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f6ce060a3bb8d7b4ad7bc8d73d67b506.mp4?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/97c0f894ef908e26e42114e470b91637.webp?t=1780295384\" width=323 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master advanced movement mechanics like bunny hopping and surfing to blaze through dynamic levels and deliver pizzas at lightning speed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f16e48de744f373fc2c10ace6228e750.poster.avif?t=1780295384\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f16e48de744f373fc2c10ace6228e750.webm?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/f16e48de744f373fc2c10ace6228e750.mp4?t=1780295384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/extras/3d2ab9d9281dcbac6e66d2b0b2df5219.webp?t=1780295384\" width=437 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you deliver, 