-person movement with bunny hopping and surfing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time attack gameplay focused on speed and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple  locations with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medal system and global leaderboards per route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost system to see how other players achieved their time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor to create and share custom routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver fast. Move faster. Become a legend of Pizza Dash!</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A high-speed first-person delivery game where movement is everything. Bunny hop, surf, and race the clock to climb the leaderboards and become the ultimate pizza courier!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/d11a323152906f5f93033bdb5cd57e0dd1abde40/header.jpg?t=1780295384", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/5ab28036d5497707f88b787959b67e19306c775d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780295384", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525320/5ab28036d5497707f88b787959b67e19306c775d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780295384", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB Dedicated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements may change in future updates</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "develop